{"id": "EUVD-2024-55786", "enisaUuid": "3fdff812-08c3-3aa9-b5ef-04ba2f260f54", "description": "Frappe before 14.58.0 and 15.x before 15.4.0 contains a cross-site scripting vulnerability in printview because printview parameters are not escaped before being rendered. Remote attackers can craft a malicious printview URL that, when visited by a victim, injects HTML and executes script in the victim's browser session.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T22:21:45", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T13:33:51", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/frappe/security/advisories/GHSA-v248-pv3c-jvgw", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/frappe-before-15.4.0-xss-via-printview-parameters"], "aliases": ["CVE-2024-58391", "GHSA-8v87-5f8f-xgxh"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.26, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3828f8ea-7097-3974-8a99-1929ce2c372a", "product": {"name": "frappe", "vendor": {"name": "Elated-Themes"}}, "product_version": "15.0.0 <15.4.0"}, {"id": "50796f4e-37b7-3cfa-bb3d-2a176a11bf7f", "product": {"name": "frappe", "vendor": {"name": "Elated-Themes"}}, "product_version": "0 <14.58.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "31e162ab-7c1a-39cf-8ef1-468d32f0a833", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}